              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwathani aranjĩĩra atĩrĩ: “Mwaka ũmwe ũtanathira, ũtarĩtwo ta ũrĩa mĩaka ya mũndũ wa kwandĩkwo wĩra ĩrĩkanagĩrwo-rĩ, riiri wothe wa Kedari nĩũgaathira.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.21.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.21.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 21:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Andũ arĩa magaatigario nĩ thigari iria ciikagia mĩguĩ, o acio njamba cia ita cia Kedari-rĩ, magaakorwo marĩ o anini.” Jehova Ngai wa Isiraeli nĩwe warĩtie ũhoro ũcio.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.21.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.21.17"
            ]
          }
        }
